<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear Future Sun Devil,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear Sun Devil,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Your life as a university student is exciting and filled with opportunities. At times it can also be challenging, and many people are available to provide you with the right level of support for any issue you may encounter. Our focus is ensuring that you make the most of your ASU experience and meet your academic and personal goals. From career guidance to managing stressful situations, we are prepared to assist you. Our mission is your success, and we work diligently to be the best resource possible. Below is a list of the services and departments available to support you.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/counseling">ASU Counseling Services</a>&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/health">ASU Health Services</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/wellness">ASU Wellness</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/cs">Career Services</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/drc/">Disability Resource Center</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/international">International Student Office</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/ocss/">OCSS (Off-Campus Student Services)</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/out">OUT@ASU</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://veterans.asu.edu/">Pat Tillman Veterans Center</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/dos/srr/StudentAdvocacyandAssistance">Student Advocacy</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://tutoring.asu.edu/"><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://tutoring.asu.edu/">Student Success - Tutoring and Writing Centers</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/trio">TRiO Student Support Services</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Kindest Regards</b>,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">New College Recruitment Team</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#990000">Arizona State University, West campus</font></div><div style="